{
  "audio": "pixar_intro_audio.mp3",
  "title": "July intro 1 — The Secrets of Longevity",
  "beats": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 8,
      "vo": "What if the secret to a long life wasn't found in medicine, or money, or even genetics?",
      "hero": "beat0_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat0_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "push-in"
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 8,
      "end": 16.5,
      "vo": "What if living well is not measured by how many years you have? Think about this for a moment.",
      "hero": "beat1_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat1_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "pull-back"
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 16.5,
      "end": 27,
      "vo": "How rich are you? Not in money, not in houses, not in possessions.",
      "hero": "beat2_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat2_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "dolly-left"
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 27,
      "end": 35.16,
      "vo": "How rich are you in this?",
      "hero": "beat3_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat3_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "push-in"
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 35.16,
      "end": 46.48,
      "vo": "With long life will I satisfy you, and show you my salvation.",
      "hero": "beat4_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat4_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "crane-up"
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 46.48,
      "end": 55.36,
      "vo": "Even if you lived to be a hundred years old, you would have only thirty-six thousand five hundred days.",
      "hero": "beat5_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat5_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "dolly-right"
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 55.36,
      "end": 67.9,
      "vo": "That's only eight hundred and seventy-six thousand hours. No one leaves this world with a million.",
      "hero": "beat6_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat6_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "push-in"
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 67.9,
      "end": 76.24,
      "vo": "Time is the one currency God places into your hands every morning.",
      "hero": "beat7_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat7_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "pull-back"
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 76.24,
      "end": 85,
      "vo": "That raises a question. Why do some live long, while others are taken so young?",
      "hero": "beat8_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat8_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "dolly-left"
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 85,
      "end": 94.8,
      "vo": "Abraham, a hundred and seventy-five years. Isaac, a hundred and eighty. Jacob, a hundred and forty-seven.",
      "hero": "beat9_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat9_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "dolly-right"
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 94.8,
      "end": 103,
      "vo": "Was it merely genetics? Was it environment? Or has God revealed timeless principles for a long, faithful life?",
      "hero": "beat10_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat10_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "push-in"
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 103,
      "end": 111,
      "vo": "For as the days of a tree, so shall the days of my people be. A healthy tree is deeply rooted.",
      "hero": "beat11_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat11_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "crane-up"
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 111,
      "end": 120.8,
      "vo": "It stands through storms. It keeps growing. It keeps bearing fruit, year after year.",
      "hero": "beat12_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat12_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "orbit"
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 120.8,
      "end": 130.96,
      "vo": "Not a life cut short. Not a life merely existing. A life rooted, fruitful, finishing well.",
      "hero": "beat13_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat13_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "pull-back"
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 130.96,
      "end": 137.2,
      "vo": "This series is not about adding years to your life, but adding life to your years.",
      "hero": "beat14_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat14_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "dolly-right"
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 137.2,
      "end": 144.5,
      "vo": "Purpose to every season, faithfulness to every decade. Welcome to The Secrets of Longevity.",
      "hero": "beat15_hero.png",
      "depth": "beat15_hero_depth.png",
      "veo": null,
      "motion": "push-in"
    }
  ],
